exports[`Hoy en inglés (#299) > Hoy completo: meta semanal, tu semana, números y peso en lb 1`] = `"Monday, November 9 Good morning , Andrés How does it work? 11 A Monday, strength day Total strength: legs, chest and shoulders Legs, chest and shoulders with a weight that goes up every week: more strength for everything, from carrying groceries to climbing stairs. 46 minutes 4 exercises 13 sets (rounds) Start today's workout , about 46 minutes How do you feel today? Optional Pick one and Coach Banana adjusts your workout to how you feel today. Tired One less set, lighter Normal Your plan as is All in One extra rep Coach Banana Today you build base strength in your legs, chest and shoulders. Last time you did back squat with 197.5 lb × 6: today try 7 reps. What you'll do Swipe to see them all 1 Back squat 4 sets of 5 to 8 Works: Legs See how it's done 2 Bench press 4 sets of 6 to 10 Works: Chest See how it's done 3 Standing overhead press 3 sets of 6 to 10 Works: Shoulders See how it's done 4 Weighted dips 2 sets of 8 to 12 Works: Triceps See how it's done A set is a round of reps in a row. You rest between sets. Yesterday Active rest Tomorrow Wide back and strong biceps This week: 0 of 6 workouts 1 week hitting your goal Daily streak: 11 days See my progress New: train at home Switch to home mode in your profile and your routine adapts to dumbbells and body weight. Try it This week: 0 km 48 days to your race Your numbers today Food Left 1,240 kcal You ate 1,260 kcal Your goal 2,500 kcal Protein 101 / 185 g 84 g to go. Protein protects your muscle while you lose fat. Carbs 141 / 283 g Energy to train Fat 28 / 70 g Hormones and fullness What have you eaten today? Log food Breakfast Rice and beans with scrambled eggs 430 kcal, 28 g protein Lunch Chicken with rice, beans and plantain 620 kcal, 52 g protein Snack Greek yogurt with papaya 210 kcal, 21 g protein Dinner Log Coach Banana recommends. For your snack: Microwave egg mug 360 kcal and 40 g of protein (2 servings) These work too: Lemon tilapia with cassava. See the recipe You eat about 500 kcal less than you burn: that's how you lose fat at a good pace. See my meal plan Water 5 / 8 glasses 1 glass Steps 4,820 / 10,000 1,000 Sleep 7.5 / 8 h ½ h Coach Banana express Running out of time? Finish with one of these express workouts No equipment, just your body weight, in a 7 × 7 ft space. It counts toward your streak. Express workout, 10 min Wake up Get your body going Express workout, 20 min Burn Raise your heart rate Express workout, 30 min Complete Full body Your week See plan Workouts 0 / 6 Streak 11 days XP points 0 M today T coming up W coming up T coming up F coming up S coming up S - rest 6 workouts to go to complete your week. Every workout counts to keep your muscle. Level 4: Big Plantain +0 XP today 310 XP to go for Strong Monkey Weekly goal: 0 of 700 XP Train +10 XP per set Your challenges Challenge shop 30 Banana Days Day 11 of 30 10 / 30 Streak 10 days in a row Free passes 3 of 3 free passes free passes Goal 10 / 27 for the medal Today: Complete any workout; if you're low on energy, use easy mode Checks off on its own when you save your workout 4 more days done to reach the day 14 milestone (+25 XP) See calendar Push-up King Day 3 of 30 2 / 30 Streak 2 days in a row Free passes 3 of 3 free passes free passes Goal 2 / 27 for the medal Today: 16 push-ups total today (in as many sets as you like) Done 5 more days done to reach the day 7 milestone (+25 XP) See calendar Did you weigh in yet? See trend When you wake up, after the bathroom, before eating. 205.3 lb Save −4.0 lb lost 17.9 lb to goal 52 days Coach Banana 3-1-1 tempo on every rep. Lowering slowly is where muscle is built."`;

